<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Soybean Oil:  Sales of 42,700 MT were primarily the result of increases for unknown destinations (25,000 MT), China (10,000 MT), and Mexico (3,100 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 3,400 MT were to Mexico (3,200 MT) and Canada (200 MT).</p>
</text>
